        Code statements:
        <text1>
        <text2>
        ...
        <textN>

Code statements:
```c
-		goto out;
+		goto err_function;

 	dev->state = MLX5_DEVICE_STATE_UP;

+err_function:
 	dev->state = MLX5_DEVICE_STATE_INTERNAL_ERROR;
```

